            "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:01:48.616668+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 1:\n [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900)\n\nAlternatives:\n [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) \n [Adrenaline Shot](item_ab8eba6a-0bda-4b12-8854-4ba4169b515f) \n\nNerd Breakdown:\n\nCompensator takes our rocket damage from 120 to ~126 on a target without armor/damage reduction. Power Playbook takes our Concussive blast from ~110 (on a single target with all mini rockets) to ~121, which also affects multiple enemies. Weapon Grease doesn't have much impact on our damage this early (taking about 10-12 rockets before the damage scales beyond the base). With  [Speed Kills](item_2ee0fb37-d15c-4f4c-bac5-26f04794fee9) gaining stacks from any damage source, you'll be firing more primary than you will concussive blasts due to cooldowns and increased attack speed.\n\nArmored Vest + Electrolytes offers you the safest sustained choice. Adrenaline Shot over Armored Vest can also be considered if you are familiar with health pack spawns and lack of projectiles on the enemy team (Armored Vest will always be great against Reaper, Soldier, Dva, Orisa, Junker Queen etc)",
