            "notes": "Did you get  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) last round? \n\nIf you can afford it:  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)  next.\n\nOtherwise, fill out your items with an appropriate situational epic.\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if they have enough armor users to warrant it or one really frustrating hero.\n [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) underrated item, great vs  [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d),  [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88), and  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49).\n [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) increases survivability.\n\nIf you did not get  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) on round 4, purchase it now. Fill out your items with a blue of your choice. I'm fond of  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) ,  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) ,  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) , and  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).",
